{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2021-06-24 17:37:00', 'title': 'CENTENE CORPORATION PRICES OFFERING OF SENIOR NOTES', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS, JUNE 24, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CENTENE CORPORATION (NYSE: CNC) ("CENTENE" OR THE "COMPANY") ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS PRICED ITS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED UNDERWRITTEN PUBLIC OFFERING OF $1,800,000,000\xa0AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 2.450% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2028 (THE "NOTES"). THE OFFERING IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE ON OR ABOUT JULY 1, 2021, SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS.'}